MODE FEATUREEDITOR MODE CREATE RECT_POCKET
ROTATE TRANSFORM TOP
PICK -232.031 -172.333 232.031 172.333 37.3389 -7.8899 -13 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 -36.4456 11.7088 -36.4456 11.7088
